.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122855.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-31T19:55:07Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`GDScriptDocGen` uses \"GDType\" as an alias of `GDScriptParser::DataType`, which is also the name of a core type (although newer than the alias).\r\n\r\nWhile the current code doesn't conflict with the core `GDType` (the include tree contains `gdtype.h`), I think it's better to avoid confusion. I've changed the alias to ~~`GDPType`~~ `DataType` as requested.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122855/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122855/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}